ent-ActionXenoRest = Rest
    .desc = Lie down to regenerate faster.
ent-ActionXenoEvolve = Evolve
    .desc = Evolve into a stronger caste.
ent-ActionXenoPlantWeeds = Plant Weeds
    .desc = Plant a weed node that spreads across the floor.
ent-ActionXenoChooseStructure = Choose Resin Structure
    .desc = Choose what structure to secrete next.
ent-ActionXenoSecreteStructure = Secrete Resin
    .desc = Build the structure chosen with Choose Resin Structure.
ent-ActionXenoAcidNormal = Corrosive Acid
    .desc = Melt a structure or object with acid.
ent-ActionXenoAcidWeak = Weak Corrosive Acid
    .desc = Slowly melt a structure or object with weak acid.
ent-ActionXenoTailStab = Tail Stab
    .desc = Stab a nearby target with your tail.
ent-ActionXenoLeap = Leap
    .desc = Leap toward a location and knock down nearby hosts.
ent-ActionXenoSpit = Spit
    .desc = Spit acid at a target location.
ent-ActionXenoCrest = Crest Defense
    .desc = Raise your crest to reduce incoming damage at the cost of speed.
ent-ActionXenoFortify = Fortify
    .desc = Dig in and greatly reduce damage taken while slowing to a crawl.
ent-ActionXenoHeadbutt = Headbutt
    .desc = Charge into a target and knock them back.
ent-ActionXenoTailSweep = Tail Sweep
    .desc = Sweep your tail around you, knocking down nearby hosts.
ent-ActionXenoCharge = Charge
    .desc = Charge toward a location and smash through hosts.
ent-ActionXenoPunch = Punch
    .desc = Punch a nearby host, knocking them back and slowing them.
ent-ActionXenoLunge = Lunge
    .desc = Lunge at a target, stun them, and drag them to you.
ent-ActionXenoFling = Fling
    .desc = Fling a nearby host away, stunning and slowing them.
ent-ActionXenoInvisibility = Cloak
    .desc = Cloak yourself from sight.
ent-ActionXenoScreech = Screech
    .desc = Unleash a stunning screech.
ent-ActionXenoPheromones = Emit Pheromones
    .desc = Choose a pheromone aura that buffs nearby hive sisters. Costs plasma to start and each second while active.
ent-ActionXenoLayEgg = Lay Egg
    .desc = Stand on weeds and after 30 seconds lay a xenonid egg beneath you.
